## Uncertainty
- Cluster bootstrap over projects (only 4 clusters, Economics = 1 cluster): Econ−rest = +0.247, 95% CI [−0.069, 0.329], P(≤0)=0.35.
- iid pair bootstrap (ignores ml1/ml3 clustering): 95% CI [−0.008, 0.493], P(≤0)=0.029.
→ direction consistent across all specs, but with n=18 Economics pairs and 4 projects the advantage over Cognitive/Social is not significant at 5% once clustering is respected.
